From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PickleHik3 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Compile out NetworkManager: -Dnetworkmanager=false

No libnm: no network authentication agent, connectivity manager or Wi-Fi network list, and the
Wi-Fi manager and the WWAN manager's base class are the ones in wifi-manager-none.c and
wwan-manager-none.c. They have no hardware to report, which is what the NetworkManager ones
say when the daemon is not on the bus, so the Wi-Fi and mobile data tiles stay insensitive and
the status icons stay hidden.

